Two-stage diagram. Stage 1 "Static (pre-deploy)": a .tf file scanned by Checkov
before anything exists. Stage 2 "Posture (runtime)": OpenTofu applies to a moto
emulated AWS account, then Prowler scans the live account's actual resources and
reports findings. Caption: posture scanning also catches drift and
console-created resources that static scans miss. Flat style. max-width 900px.
